"No, it's true. They don't -- the black community does nothing to help us live. Nothing. The tabloids, the newspapers, the record companies, they will produce rock and rap. Have you ever seen a picture of Duke Ellington on the cover of Ebony Magazine or Charlie Parker or Billie Holliday, on any of these black tabloids? It's just like Egypt. It's not theirs. Don't know anything about it.", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "string"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q12069$787DA712-76B3-4764-B732-EF3F941F6F45", "rank": "normal"}]}}